Use the [`interactiveDismissDisabled`](https://docs.expo.dev/versions/v58.0.0/sdk/ui/swift-ui/modifiers.md#interactivedismissdisabledisdisabled) modifier to prevent users from dismissing the sheet by swiping.

```tsx NonDismissibleBottomSheetExample.tsx
import { useState } from 'react';
import {
  Host,
