### `WorkletCallback`

Supported platforms: iOS, tvOS.

A worklet function wrapped for native code, returned by [`useWorkletCallback`](https://docs.expo.dev/versions/v58.0.0/sdk/ui/swift-ui/usenativestate.md#useworkletcallbackcallback). Pass it to a modifier or prop that accepts worklet callbacks, which then runs it synchronously on the UI thread.

